@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create a draft (use a new name when repeating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "运营数据助手",
  "system_prompt": "分析提供的运营数据并返回结论。",
  "model_config": {"connection_id": "model-demo"},
  "input_schema": {"type": "object"},
  "tags": ["demo"]
}

> {% client.global.set("agentId", response.body.id); %}

### List drafts
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents?offset=0&limit=20

### Filter by tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents?tag=demo&limit=20

### Draft detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}

### Publish immutable snapshot
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/versions

### Edit only draft
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"system_prompt": "分析数据并列出关键指标与限制。"}

### List versions
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/versions

### Version 1 retains original prompt
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/versions/1
